<title>NEW ZEALAND: Cedenco slips to NZ$6.11 mln yr loss.</title>
<headline>Cedenco slips to NZ$6.11 mln yr loss.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			     6.11 vs 3.51 profit</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		    loss 39.5 vs 23.5 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover			     35.89 vs 42.82</p>
<p>    Pretax loss			   6.37 vs 4.66 profit</p>
<p>    Tax			     credit 0.5 vs 1.15</p>
<p>    Equity earnings		loss 0.25 vs n/a</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
